   RowBox[{"12", "\[Cross]", "8", "\[Cross]", "8"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"e9b6143c-9862-4014-a4ae-13a84926334e"],
 ". Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s confirm that."
}], "Text",
