Cell[TextData[{
 "In the case of Cyclic subgroups, finding subgroups is easier (by virtue of \
Fundamental Theorem of Cyclic Groups). For example, even finding subgroups of \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["U", "997"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a1ab9758-4794-4efc-bae6-0555da5b1c7b"],
 " (order 996) is a doable task."
}], "Text",
